### 10. LEGACY LED TEST ENDPOINTS (Kept for integration verification)
### ====================================================================
###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/devices/led-strip/power/on

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/devices/led-strip/power/off

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/devices/led-strip/rgb?r=255&g=0&b=0

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/devices/led-strip/rgb?r=0&g=255&b=0

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/devices/led-strip/rgb?r=0&g=0&b=255

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/devices/led-strip/brightness?brightness=50